<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Message Received</title>
</head>

<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f5f7; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
    style="background-color:#f4f5f7; padding:32px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
          style="background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">

          <!-- Header -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background-color:#111827; padding:28px 32px;">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                <tr>
                  <td style="color:#ffffff; font-size:18px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.3px;">
                    Shahdat Hossain
                  </td>
                  <td align="right" style="color:#9ca3af; font-size:12px;">
                    Full-Stack Developer
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Body -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:36px 32px 8px 32px;">
              <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:16px; color:#111827;">
                Hi John Doe,
              </p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#374151;">
                Thanks for reaching out through my portfolio. I've received your message and
                genuinely appreciate you taking the time to get in touch.
              </p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#374151;">
                I go through messages personally, so you can expect a reply from me directly
                &mdash; usually within <strong>24&ndash;48 hours</strong>. If your request is time-sensitive,
                feel free to mention that and I'll prioritize accordingly.
              </p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 24px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#374151;">
                In the meantime, feel free to take a look at some of my recent work below.
              </p>

              <!-- CTA Button -->
              <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 28px 0;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="border-radius:6px; background-color:#111827;">
                    <a href="https://your-portfolio-domain.com/projects"
                      style="display:inline-block; padding:12px 22px; font-size:14px; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; font-weight:500;">
                      View My Work
                    </a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <p style="margin:0 0 4px 0; font-size:15px; color:#374151;">
                Best regards,
              </p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 24px 0; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#111827;">
                Shahdat Hossain
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Divider -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 32px;">
              <hr style="border:none; border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb; margin:0;" />
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Footer -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:20px 32px 28px 32px;">
              <p style="margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:13px; color:#6b7280;">
                Connect with me:
                <a href="https://github.com/your-username"
                  style="color:#111827; text-decoration:none; margin:0 6px;">GitHub</a>&bull;
                <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/your-username"
                  style="color:#111827; text-decoration:none; margin:0 6px;">LinkedIn</a>&bull;
                <a href="https://your-portfolio-domain.com"
                  style="color:#111827; text-decoration:none; margin:0 6px;">Portfolio</a>
              </p>
              <p style="margin:0; font-size:12px; color:#9ca3af;">
                This is an automated confirmation &mdash; my personal reply will follow shortly.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>

        <p style="margin:16px 0 0 0; font-size:12px; color:#9ca3af;">
          &copy; 2026 Shahdat Hossain. All rights reserved.
        </p>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>

</html>